---
title: Figure 2.5 — Sequence, a personalized chat turn
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Learner
    participant UI as Chat.jsx
    participant R as chat_router
    participant CS as ChatService
    participant LP as LearnerProfileService
    participant RAG as RAG Retriever
    participant PB as Prompt Builder
    participant LLM as Groq API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    L->>UI: types a question
    UI->>UI: optimistic user bubble,<br/>pin as scroll anchor
    UI->>R: POST /chat/message {session_id, content}

    R->>CS: send_message(session_id, user_id, content)

    rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
        note over CS,DB: Authorize before writing anything
        CS->>DB: get_session(session_id)
        DB-->>CS: session
        CS->>CS: owner mismatch or missing → 404
    end

    CS->>DB: INSERT user message

    rect rgb(238, 242, 255)
        note over CS,RAG: Gather personalization signals
        CS->>LP: get_personalization_context(user_id)
        LP->>DB: profile + all concept mastery
        DB-->>LP: rows
        LP->>LP: derive strengths (≥0.7)<br/>and weaknesses (<0.4)
        LP-->>CS: style, pace, detail, strengths,<br/>weaknesses, learner_summary

        CS->>RAG: retrieve(query=content, concept_node_id, limit=3)
        RAG->>RAG: embed query → 384-dim vector
        RAG->>DB: ORDER BY embedding <=> query
        DB-->>RAG: nearest reference chunks
        RAG-->>CS: grounding material
    end

    CS->>PB: build_system_prompt(profile, chunks)
    PB-->>CS: persona + memory + adaptation rules + references

    CS->>DB: recent messages (20, or summary + 10 if long)
    DB-->>CS: history

    CS->>LLM: chat completion (temperature 0.7)
    LLM-->>CS: explanation

    CS->>CS: build_reasons(profile, chunks)
    note right of CS: Snapshot taken now, not at render time —<br/>the profile evolves, and an old message<br/>should show the profile that shaped it
    CS->>DB: INSERT assistant message + reasons

    CS->>DB: INSERT engagement event

    opt every 5th message
        CS->>LP: maybe_update_summary()
        LP->>LLM: merge new observations into learner memory
        LLM-->>LP: revised summary
        LP->>DB: UPDATE learner_profiles
        note right of LP: Failures here are swallowed —<br/>memory is an enhancement, not<br/>a reason to lose the reply
    end

    CS-->>R: saved message
    R-->>UI: {content, personalization_reasons}
    UI-->>L: rendered markdown +<br/>"Why this response" pill
